             (contract-tests . "tests/test-ci-cohort-report.rkt (18 tests) extended first with C2-specific assertions: (1) cohort mode vocabulary post-promotion|paired-shadow is pinned in cohort.json and echoed in report.json so every number names which mode produced it; (2) post-promotion cohorts must reference the promoted defaults and must not duplicate a shadow/paired cohort's sample provenance; (3) reliability counters (attempts, successes, failures, cancelled, reruns) must sum per-SHA without dropping SHAs; (4) exclusions require named reasons; (5) --check enforces SHA256SUMS binding over the artifact set")
