                         (digest-provenance . "digest b7f8b341... is computed over the two current non-artifact files at implementation-sha 56d3f689bfd9e2ea0bbdba6a9557021b5541b2e5 with the exact reproduction command recorded above; the record-only commits that add these rktd files touch no digest input")))))
